This app allows restaurants to receive, accept and prepare orders from TaxiF Orders delivery service.

TaxiF Orders is app for restaurant staff helping them keep and handle all orders in one place.

With the help of TaxiF Orders restaurant staff and managers can:
- receive or decline orders;
- change order status;
- keep track of cooking and delivery time;
- fill menu catalogue to display actual present items ready for delivery;
- look for the nearest drivers who can deliver the order.

Install TaxiF Orders app to enjoy ease and simplicity of handling and managing orders delivery in one place.

